{"steam_appid":4991240,"steam_name":"Witch Cabin Cleanup","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4991240/1110819089/92501d4803e33ac26385dc680f9255658bc7fdc1/1784891569/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784892187","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257383973/dc07737ba9dc3a3d532f098c86663f1e19211ab1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784892187","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/0012e48b82667ccbeea43fd963716c0220ff9066/ss_0012e48b82667ccbeea43fd963716c0220ff9066.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791876877","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/b05857e2e3661f363fc3e7ba0daac1ff63c7cdcd/ss_b05857e2e3661f363fc3e7ba0daac1ff63c7cdcd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791876877","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/e335cf5f8a7161f957dab1357f8f8bfa86871be8/ss_e335cf5f8a7161f957dab1357f8f8bfa86871be8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791876877","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/ad4ff05393fd615a5247231e8f37aac6ecdcc96b/ss_ad4ff05393fd615a5247231e8f37aac6ecdcc96b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791876877","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/e3f2386c5d756f9d786a7baddc4e7df851184695/ss_e3f2386c5d756f9d786a7baddc4e7df851184695.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791876877"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witch's Cabin Cleanup is a cozy organizing simulator about putting a cluttered witch's cabin back in order. Sort 5,313 curios across 6 rooms: the apothecary, the library, the greenhouse, the ritual chamber, and more. All at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Witch's Cabin Organizing Simulator</strong><br>The cabin is a mess, and the magic only made it worse. Return everything to its proper shelf at your own pace, with no timers and no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/1366904ffae3f7139468e471e10e8caa.avif?t=1791876877\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.poster.avif?t=1791876877\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.webm?t=1791876877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/bf16f11daaedd7c8fa58e4f7bff1a412.mp4?t=1791876877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up each item: a potion vial, a loose spellbook, or a jar of moth wings, find the room and shelf it belongs on, and set it in place. Work through the cabin one shelf at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/202e9013da40b5672477689d890fef7f.avif?t=1791876877\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.poster.avif?t=1791876877\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.webm?t=1791876877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/7d93c172c2111150948d957ea2b29e99.mp4?t=1791876877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrades as you play. Move faster, reach farther, and unlock a few small spells: a levitation charm, a banishing wand, that make tidying the cabin quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/fc7942fb19277a6f8af7f8e7acd06eb7.avif?t=1791876877\" width=1170 height=99 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/004f03000ec200c92f380963643fe7ed.poster.avif?t=1791876877\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/004f03000ec200c92f380963643fe7ed.webm?t=1791876877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4991240/extras/004f03000ec200c92f380963643fe7ed.mp4?t=1791876877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cluttered shelves fill with neat rows of labelled jars, and the tangled herb rack settles into order. Each finished room shows clear progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort more than 5,300 curios across 6 rooms of a witch's cabin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay: pick things up and put them back where they belong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill upgrades for speed and reach, plus a few magical abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limits and no game over. A relaxed pace you set yourself</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Quad-core Intel or AMD processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 | AMD Radeon RX-580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Simulation"],"developers":["Cleanup Crew!"],"publishers":["Cleanup Crew!"],"release_date":"Oct 12, 2026"}